  "prefLabel": "Fis 1502.01 Forms",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fis 1502.01 Forms. Whenever a person is required to complete a hardcopy or electronic form, the following shall apply:\n\n(a) Forms shall be filled out completely;\n\n(b) Forms shall be completed in a legible manner; and\n\n(c) All statements made on any form shall be true to the best information and belief of the person making the statement, in accordance with RSA 641:3.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Fis 1500) #12590, eff 7-25-18; ss by #14306, eff 7-9-25, EXPIRES: 7-9-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/fis1500.html"
